    "memoEntities": {
      "memo_legend": {
        "id": "memo_legend",
        "value": "PagePass MVP target ERD\n\nBlue: auth    Green: family\nCyan: device  Amber: app policy\nRed: time     Purple: reading/OCR\nGray: system and operations\n\nTarget model, not the current migration state.\nStandalone design artifact.",
        "ui": {
          "x": 14500,
          "y": 100,
          "zIndex": 1000,
          "width": 2500,
          "height": 850,
          "color": "#176B5B"
        },
        "meta": {
          "updateAt": 1784323200000,
          "createAt": 1784323200000
        }
      },
      "memo_constraints": {
        "id": "memo_constraints",
        "value": "PostgreSQL invariants not fully expressible by ERD Editor\n\n1. One active device per child:\n   UNIQUE(child_profile_id) WHERE status = 'active'.\n2. One unsettled Earned Time session per child:\n   UNIQUE(child_profile_id) WHERE state IN\n   ('prepared','active','settlement_pending').\n3. One pending app request per managed app:\n   UNIQUE(child_profile_id, managed_app_id)\n   WHERE status = 'pending'.\n4. credit_ledger_entries and submission_reviews are append-only.\n5. Ledger append and child_credit_balances projection update occur in one transaction.\n6. Approved review + reading_reward ledger append occur in one transaction.\n7. Earned Time settled session maps to exactly one session_spend ledger row.\n8. Child-scoped composite FKs prevent cross-child device/app/media references.\n9. Exactly one notification recipient FK is non-null.\n10. At most one audit actor FK is non-null; system events may have none.\n11. profile_media_id and cover/evidence media must be complete and correct kind.\n12. Pairing expires after 5 minutes and is single-use; new session invalidates old open session.\n13. Opaque app tokens, APNs tokens, and credentials never enter logs/audit payloads.\n14. Domain records are archived/revoked; hard delete is reserved for retention jobs.\n15. Exactly one media uploader FK is non-null (Parent or child device).\n16. Review checks: approved requires reward > 0; change/reject require comment and reward = 0.\n17. Session checks: expires = starts + requested; consumed follows manual/expiry rules.\n18. Ledger source columns must match entry_type; balance may never become negative.\n19. MVP permits one active family membership per Parent via partial unique index.\n20. Every policy revision has one or more app_policy_changes and updates managed_apps atomically.",
        "ui": {
          "x": 14500,
          "y": 1100,
          "zIndex": 1000,
          "width": 2500,
          "height": 2200,
          "color": "#C84949"
        },
        "meta": {
          "updateAt": 1784323200000,
          "createAt": 1784323200000
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
